{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/9/4d97ab5c672615853d322347c7b4f396075c9ecd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^7$\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> in the expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/1/e316570f48acff0eafcc925d0e017a668cc8cc2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{2}{x}\\right)^8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"90\" height=\"47\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/c/52c93a33fd9a85b3ac9f004468e25011875af8de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 56\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -56\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 14\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ -14\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"429\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Binomial_Theorem\" title=\"Binomial Theorem\">Binomial Theorem</a>, each term of the expansion is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/f/50f52924ea089fbbdb7ac24b2b4ebf56a0b1c715.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{8}{n}\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right)^{8-n}\\left(\\frac{-2}{x}\\right)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"180\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p><p>We want the exponent of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/4/da406a3c74e21d3222f3da34ca29c9499aafecb5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2(8-n)-n=7\\]\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/2/b42cac801908ead0872f3b1a9bbdba75b038447a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[16-3n=7\\]\" width=\"92\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74ac5915a3e58b5ed0da41429618c1f8ab34e598.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n=3\\]\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5635737307f5f0651cced8ee2e6558a426fd27b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, then the corresponding term is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/2/79276dde4a859e87568d37980d5743845f2abf8f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\binom{8}{3}\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right)^{5}\\left(\\frac{-2}{x}\\right)^3\\]\" width=\"154\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/6/2260d96bd30607a4f60bb7ac1bc0ee81668d6823.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[56 \\cdot \\frac{x^{10}}{32} \\cdot \\frac{-8}{x^3}\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/9/289a7c85f9e76ff317826b8a1cc3cada153d8e60.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-14x^7\\]\" width=\"47\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" title=\"1960 AHSME\">1960 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1960 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1960\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> 